THE QUOTIENT REDUCTION:
  LRC@14 reduces to: observer beats all 7 CRT classes
  Each class is a 2-runner sub-problem (except class 0: 1 runner)
  Class beaten iff BOTH runners safe: ||at||>=1/14 AND ||(a+7)t||>=1/14
  For class k: this is ||kt||>=1/14 AND ||(k+7)t||>=1/14

